    "updated_at": "2023-05-09T18:50:01Z",
    "body": "There is a real issue, userland uses `addEventListener(\"abort\"` for resource cleanup and other listeners being able to prevent that is unfortunate.\r\n\r\nAt the moment AbortSignal _already_ has a second dispatch mechanism but it's only exposed to the dom internally and `AbortSignal.any` adds a third.",
